# Probe artefacts must round-trip byte-for-byte.
#
# Python's csv module emits CRLF per RFC 4180, and this machine has
# core.autocrlf=input, which would strip those CRs on commit and rewrite the
# working copy on checkout. For research outputs that people checksum against
# the original Colab download, that silently corrupts the artefact.
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion and stores the bytes as-is.
*.csv       -text
*.jsonl     -text

# Binary: never diff, never convert.
*.png       binary
*.ipynb     -text
